  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to diversification of agriculture for improved nutrition and rural livelihoods in selected COVID-19 hotspot zones of Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the issues of quantification of impacts of community spreads of COVID-19 on poverty and climate changes in the selected district of the BADP and the identification of area of interventions for improving climate resilient agricultural production to support improved food, nutrition and livelihoods of the rural poor specially women.</narrative>
  </description>
